hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1095","(125) Musla karne ki mumaniat ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Hayyaj se ke ek ghulam - shayad unhon ne kaha ke us ne apne baap se - bhaag gaya, to us ne nazr mani ke agar wo us par qadir ho gaya to zaroor us mein se koi tukda kaat dega, phir jab wo us ke paas wapas aa gaya to us ne mujhe Imran ibn Husayn ke paas bheja, to main ne un se pucha, to Imran Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Jo apne ghulam ko azad karna chahe ya apni qasam ka kaffara dena chahe, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) humein sadqe ki targheeb dete the aur musla karne se mana farmate the. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Samurah ke paas aya, to unhon ne Imran ki baat jaisi baat kahi."
